"Records with HEVC with Alpha, so transparent areas stay transparent in the video.\n\n• Turning it on fixes the encoder to H.265 and the format to MOV.\n• When recording an application, the Background menu then offers \"Transparent\": everything outside the selected apps' windows is transparent.\n• A full screen or screen area recording has no transparent areas, so it makes no difference there.\n• The transparency shows in apps that support transparent video, such as Final Cut Pro, Motion and Keynote. Most players and video sites don't." = "使用 HEVC with Alpha 編碼，錄影可以保留透明區域。\n\n• 開啟後，編碼器固定為 H.265，格式固定為 MOV。\n• 「錄製應用程式」時，「畫面背景」選單中會多出「透明」：所選應用程式視窗以外的區域都是透明的。\n• 錄製整個螢幕或螢幕區域時，畫面中沒有透明區域，此選項不起作用。\n• 透明效果要在 Final Cut Pro、Motion、Keynote 等支援透明影片的軟體中查看，一般播放器和多數影音網站不支援。";
